---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { Heart, Clock, Globe, ShieldCheck } from 'lucide-react';
---

<Layout title="Our Story - Jollof Factory">
  <section
    id="story"
    class="w-full py-24 bg-cream border-b-2 border-dark relative overflow-hidden"
  >
    <!-- Background elements -->
    <div class="absolute top-20 left-10 w-32 h-32 bg-secondary rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-50"></div>
    <div class="absolute bottom-20 right-10 w-64 h-64 bg-primary rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-20"></div>

    <div class="mx-auto max-w-5xl px-6 md:px-12 relative z-10">
      <!-- Header -->
      <div class="text-center mb-20">
        <span class="bg-dark text-white px-4 py-1 font-mono text-sm mb-4 inline-block -rotate-2">
          THE ORIGIN
        </span>
        <h2 class="text-5xl md:text-7xl font-display uppercase text-dark mt-4">
          A Favor.
          <br />A Batch.
          <br />
          <span class="text-primary">A Beginning.</span>
        </h2>
      </div>

      <!-- Main Narrative - Layout with image -->
      <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-12 items-center mb-24">
        <div class="w-full md:w-1/2">
          <div class="bg-white p-3 border-2 border-dark shadow-neo rotate-2 hover:rotate-0 transition-all duration-500">
            <img
              src="/ife-loop.gif"
              alt="Cooking in kitchen"
              class="w-full aspect-4/5 object-cover bg-top border-2 border-dark grayscale hover:grayscale-0 transition-all"
            />
            <div class="pt-4 pb-2 text-center font-marker text-xl text-dark">
              Where it all started
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="w-full md:w-1/2 flex flex-col gap-6">
          <p class="text-xl font-bold leading-relaxed text-dark">
            Jollof Factory started in a friend's kitchen. I made one sauce—one
            base that could stretch into many dinners. Before I left, she
            asked for a big batch. After I left, she texted:{" "}
            <span class="bg-secondary px-1">"You should sell this."</span>
          </p>
          <p class="text-lg leading-relaxed text-gray-800">
            It wasn't the first time I'd heard it. In 2020, life was loud,
            plans paused, and the idea sat on the shelf. This time, I picked
            it up.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- "Why A Base" & "What's Inside" Cards -->
      <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8 mb-24">
        <div class="bg-secondary p-8 border-2 border-dark shadow-neo flex flex-col gap-4">
          <h3 class="font-display text-3xl uppercase">Why A Base?</h3>
          <p class="font-bold text-lg">
            Because life is full. I'm a mom with a very active toddler and a
            9-to-5.
          </p>
          <p class="text-dark">
            I love big, soulful flavors, but I don't love hours of chopping
            and stirring on weeknights. A pepper-led, slow-cooked base lets me
            start strong in minutes. One spoonful, and dinner moves from "What
            now?" to "We're good."
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-dark p-8 border-2 border-dark shadow-neo flex flex-col gap-4 text-cream">
          <h3 class="font-display text-3xl uppercase text-primary">
            What's Inside
          </h3>
          <p class="font-bold text-lg">
            Sweet peppers. Ginger. A hint of garlic. Herbs. And a few secrets.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-400">
            It's tomato-free—gentler for many bellies—without losing the depth
            we love in Jollof. We slow-cook for layers, so you don't have to.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Cultural Bridge Section -->
      <div class="mb-24 relative">
        <div class="absolute -left-4 top-0 bottom-0 w-2 bg-primary"></div>
        <div class="pl-8">
          <h3 class="font-display text-4xl uppercase mb-6">
            A Bridge, Not A Gate
          </h3>
          <p class="text-xl font-medium leading-relaxed max-w-3xl">
            I cooked for a corporate client in Canada, and watched people
            light up at the flavor—pepper, aromatics, gentle heat. It became
            an invitation to taste West Africa at their own table. Your
            regular meals, just more interesting.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Promise Grid -->
      <div class="bg-white border-2 border-dark p-8 md:p-12">
        <h3 class="text-center font-display text-4xl uppercase mb-12">
          Our Promise
        </h3>
        <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8">
          <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-3">
            <div class="bg-cream p-4 rounded-full border-2 border-dark mb-2 shadow-neo">
              <Heart size={32} className="text-primary" client:visible />
            </div>
            <h4 class="font-black uppercase text-xl">Flavor First</h4>
            <p class="text-sm font-bold text-gray-600">No tomatoes, big soul.</p>
          </div>
          
          <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-3">
            <div class="bg-cream p-4 rounded-full border-2 border-dark mb-2 shadow-neo">
              <Clock size={32} className="text-primary" client:visible />
            </div>
            <h4 class="font-black uppercase text-xl">Time Saver</h4>
            <p class="text-sm font-bold text-gray-600">Seconds, not hours.</p>
          </div>
          
          <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-3">
            <div class="bg-cream p-4 rounded-full border-2 border-dark mb-2 shadow-neo">
              <Globe size={32} className="text-primary" client:visible />
            </div>
            <h4 class="font-black uppercase text-xl">Versatile</h4>
            <p class="text-sm font-bold text-gray-600">Rice, Pizza, anything.</p>
          </div>
          
          <div class="flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-3">
            <div class="bg-cream p-4 rounded-full border-2 border-dark mb-2 shadow-neo">
              <ShieldCheck size={32} className="text-primary" client:visible />
            </div>
            <h4 class="font-black uppercase text-xl">No Fuss</h4>
            <p class="text-sm font-bold text-gray-600">Performance-free cooking.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-12 pt-8 border-t-2 border-dashed border-gray-300 text-center">
          <p class="font-marker text-2xl rotate-1">
            "From my kitchen to yours—here's to bold, unfussy meals."
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
